{
    "title": "Shuru:Public News & Local News",
    "description": "Public Local News is your city's own local app, we bring you the latest news, videos, Rashifal, classifieds, and important updates from your city and enable you to connect with the people in your locality. Through the app, we want to give users a medium where the Public can find all the News and important Local videos from their city.\r\n\r\nPublic News - Local News, Mandi Bhav (\u092e\u0902\u0921\u0940 \u092d\u093e\u0935), Watch Latest News, Breaking News (\u0906\u091c \u0915\u0940 \u0924\u093e\u091c\u093e \u0916\u092c\u0930) from India.\r\nNews is available in Hindi, Tamil, Telugu, and 12+ other languages.\r\n\r\nPublic events or Festivals, Religious, Local Events, Cricket Matches, Power cuts or Water shortages, Sporting Events in your neighborhood everything was happening in your city.\r\n\r\nShuru - Your City's App - News & Local area Updates on Latest Breaking News, Today Mandi Bhav (\u092e\u0902\u0921\u0940 \u092d\u093e\u0935) and\r\nFarmers can instantly sell or purchase agricultural products to brokers, traders, and companies. People can promote their shops or businesses.\r\n\r\nThe public brings news from over 4000+ towns & cities to your phone. You will never miss out on what is happening around you or in your hometown.\r\n\r\nPublic Local News app is currently available in Hindi, Bengali, Gujarati, Marathi, Tamil, Kannada, Malayalam, Odia, Assamese, and Telugu for the people of Rajasthan, Uttar Pradesh, Haryana, Bihar, Jharkhand, Madhya Pradesh, Chhattisgarh, Punjab, Himachal Pradesh, West Bengal, Tripura, Telangana, Karnataka, Gujarat, Maharashtra, Kerala, Odisha, Tamil Nadu and Assam.\r\n\r\n\u2605Local updates on crime, politics, and news\r\n\u2605Weather updates, local crime (robberies, theft, or accidents), mandi and fuel prices\r\n\u2605Weather, horoscope, local helpline numbers, fuel, and mandi prices\r\n\u2605Jobs and vacancies in your city\r\n\u2605Raise your voice on local issues.\r\n\u2605Today Mandi Bhav (\u092e\u0902\u0921\u0940 \u092d\u093e\u0935)\r\n\u2605Real estate Buy or sell property.\r\n\u2605Public Local News available in 12+ Indian local languages.\r\n\u2605Share your short videos on interesting topics\r\n\u2605Post, share, and record your opinions and videos\r\n\u2605Public issues like water shortages, power cuts, and traffic jams\r\n\u2605Free health checkups and vaccination centers in your city\r\n\r\nStay updated with all the latest news about politics and elections from across the country. \r\nHindi news App: \u0939\u093f\u0902\u0926\u0940 \u0928\u094d\u092f\u0942\u091c\u093c \u0910\u092a brings to you Live TV, the latest news in Hindi (\u0939\u093f\u0902\u0926\u0940 \u0938\u092e\u093e\u091a\u093e\u0930), Watch Hindi news videos (\u0939\u093f\u0928\u094d\u0926\u0940 \u0916\u092c\u0930\u0947\u0902 \u2013 \u0932\u093e\u0907\u0935 \u0905\u092a\u0921\u0947\u091f), breaking news, news alerts (\u0924\u093e\u091c\u093c\u093e \u0939\u093f\u0928\u094d\u0926\u0940 \u0916\u092c\u0930), national news, international news (\u0905\u0902\u0924\u0930\u0930\u093e\u0937\u094d\u091f\u094d\u0930\u0940\u092f \u0938\u092e\u093e\u091a\u093e\u0930), local news, news from states, sports news (\u0916\u0947\u0932 \u0938\u092e\u093e\u091a\u093e\u0930), Bollywood news, crime (\u091c\u0941\u0930\u094d\u092e) news, and religion news (\u0927\u0930\u094d\u092e).\r\n\r\n<b>Features:</b>\r\n\u25c9 Public Local, app for News & Videos \u2013 Local, National & International News,\r\nPolitics, Entertainment, Cricket & much more!\r\n\r\n\u25c9 News, videos & viral cards in English, \u0939\u093f\u0902\u0926\u0940, \u0ba4\u0bae\u0bbf\u0bb4\u0bcd, \u0c24\u0c46\u0c32\u0c41\u0c17\u0c41, \u0c95\u0ca8\u0ccd\u0ca8\u0ca1,\r\n\u0d2e\u0d32\u0d2f\u0d3e\u0d33\u0d02, \u092e\u0930\u093e\u0920\u0940, \u09ac\u09be\u0982\u09b2\u09be, \u0a97\u0ac1\u0a9c\u0ab0\u0abe\u0aa4\u0ac0, \u0b13\u0b21\u0b3f\u0b06, \u0a2a\u0a70\u0a1c\u0a3e\u0a2c\u0a40, \u0627\u0631\u062f\u0648, \u092d\u094b\u091c\u092a\u0941\u0930\u0940 & \u0985\u09b8\u09ae\u09c0\u09df\u09be\r\n\r\n\u25c9 Public Local News app covers news from diverse genres - Politics, Entertainment, Sports, Business, Weather, Astrology, Finance, Technology, Fashion, Beauty, Health & Fitness & more.\r\n\r\n\u25c9 Reporters - Become a local hero by posting news and videos on the Shuru Public Gain a massive following and popularity in your city by sharing your area's latest News updates\r\n\r\n\u25c9 Get Instant Notification Alerts - With Public, be the first one to get notifications on any breaking news or local updates. Get Personalized notifications on topics of your choice & never miss out on any news in your city.\r\n\r\n\u25c9 Advertisers - Lakhs of Local Businesses, Shops, and Services come together and promote their business \r\n\r\n\u25c9 Get real-time updates on all kinds of local news - crime, accidents, water shortage, electricity cuts, road construction, traffic jams, mandi rates, etc.\r\n\r\nDownload Public Local News app now and don\u2019t miss out on what\u2019s happening in your locality. Get Local News and videos from your city!\r\n\r\nREACH US: Report any issues or share feedback on how we can improve Public Local News app. Please email us at: info@closeapp.in",
    "descriptionHTML": "Public Local News is your city&#39;s own local app, we bring you the latest news, videos, Rashifal, classifieds, and important updates from your city and enable you to connect with the people in your locality. Through the app, we want to give users a medium where the Public can find all the News and important Local videos from their city.<br><br>Public News - Local News, Mandi Bhav (\u092e\u0902\u0921\u0940 \u092d\u093e\u0935), Watch Latest News, Breaking News (\u0906\u091c \u0915\u0940 \u0924\u093e\u091c\u093e \u0916\u092c\u0930) from India.<br>News is available in Hindi, Tamil, Telugu, and 12+ other languages.<br><br>Public events or Festivals, Religious, Local Events, Cricket Matches, Power cuts or Water shortages, Sporting Events in your neighborhood everything was happening in your city.<br><br>Shuru - Your City&#39;s App - News &amp; Local area Updates on Latest Breaking News, Today Mandi Bhav (\u092e\u0902\u0921\u0940 \u092d\u093e\u0935) and<br>Farmers can instantly sell or purchase agricultural products to brokers, traders, and companies. People can promote their shops or businesses.<br><br>The public brings news from over 4000+ towns &amp; cities to your phone. You will never miss out on what is happening around you or in your hometown.<br><br>Public Local News app is currently available in Hindi, Bengali, Gujarati, Marathi, Tamil, Kannada, Malayalam, Odia, Assamese, and Telugu for the people of Rajasthan, Uttar Pradesh, Haryana, Bihar, Jharkhand, Madhya Pradesh, Chhattisgarh, Punjab, Himachal Pradesh, West Bengal, Tripura, Telangana, Karnataka, Gujarat, Maharashtra, Kerala, Odisha, Tamil Nadu and Assam.<br><br>\u2605Local updates on crime, politics, and news<br>\u2605Weather updates, local crime (robberies, theft, or accidents), mandi and fuel prices<br>\u2605Weather, horoscope, local helpline numbers, fuel, and mandi prices<br>\u2605Jobs and vacancies in your city<br>\u2605Raise your voice on local issues.<br>\u2605Today Mandi Bhav (\u092e\u0902\u0921\u0940 \u092d\u093e\u0935)<br>\u2605Real estate Buy or sell property.<br>\u2605Public Local News available in 12+ Indian local languages.<br>\u2605Share your short videos on interesting topics<br>\u2605Post, share, and record your opinions and videos<br>\u2605Public issues like water shortages, power cuts, and traffic jams<br>\u2605Free health checkups and vaccination centers in your city<br><br>Stay updated with all the latest news about politics and elections from across the country. <br>Hindi news App: \u0939\u093f\u0902\u0926\u0940 \u0928\u094d\u092f\u0942\u091c\u093c \u0910\u092a brings to you Live TV, the latest news in Hindi (\u0939\u093f\u0902\u0926\u0940 \u0938\u092e\u093e\u091a\u093e\u0930), Watch Hindi news videos (\u0939\u093f\u0928\u094d\u0926\u0940 \u0916\u092c\u0930\u0947\u0902 \u2013 \u0932\u093e\u0907\u0935 \u0905\u092a\u0921\u0947\u091f), breaking news, news alerts (\u0924\u093e\u091c\u093c\u093e \u0939\u093f\u0928\u094d\u0926\u0940 \u0916\u092c\u0930), national news, international news (\u0905\u0902\u0924\u0930\u0930\u093e\u0937\u094d\u091f\u094d\u0930\u0940\u092f \u0938\u092e\u093e\u091a\u093e\u0930), local news, news from states, sports news (\u0916\u0947\u0932 \u0938\u092e\u093e\u091a\u093e\u0930), Bollywood news, crime (\u091c\u0941\u0930\u094d\u092e) news, and religion news (\u0927\u0930\u094d\u092e).<br><br><b>Features:</b><br>\u25c9 Public Local, app for News &amp; Videos \u2013 Local, National &amp; International News,<br>Politics, Entertainment, Cricket &amp; much more!<br><br>\u25c9 News, videos &amp; viral cards in English, \u0939\u093f\u0902\u0926\u0940, \u0ba4\u0bae\u0bbf\u0bb4\u0bcd, \u0c24\u0c46\u0c32\u0c41\u0c17\u0c41, \u0c95\u0ca8\u0ccd\u0ca8\u0ca1,<br>\u0d2e\u0d32\u0d2f\u0d3e\u0d33\u0d02, \u092e\u0930\u093e\u0920\u0940, \u09ac\u09be\u0982\u09b2\u09be, \u0a97\u0ac1\u0a9c\u0ab0\u0abe\u0aa4\u0ac0, \u0b13\u0b21\u0b3f\u0b06, \u0a2a\u0a70\u0a1c\u0a3e\u0a2c\u0a40, \u0627\u0631\u062f\u0648, \u092d\u094b\u091c\u092a\u0941\u0930\u0940 &amp; \u0985\u09b8\u09ae\u09c0\u09df\u09be<br><br>\u25c9 Public Local News app covers news from diverse genres - Politics, Entertainment, Sports, Business, Weather, Astrology, Finance, Technology, Fashion, Beauty, Health &amp; Fitness &amp; more.<br><br>\u25c9 Reporters - Become a local hero by posting news and videos on the Shuru Public Gain a massive following and popularity in your city by sharing your area&#39;s latest News updates<br><br>\u25c9 Get Instant Notification Alerts - With Public, be the first one to get notifications on any breaking news or local updates. Get Personalized notifications on topics of your choice &amp; never miss out on any news in your city.<br><br>\u25c9 Advertisers - Lakhs of Local Businesses, Shops, and Services come together and promote their business <br><br>\u25c9 Get real-time updates on all kinds of local news - crime, accidents, water shortage, electricity cuts, road construction, traffic jams, mandi rates, etc.<br><br>Download Public Local News app now and don\u2019t miss out on what\u2019s happening in your locality. Get Local News and videos from your city!<br><br>REACH US: Report any issues or share feedback on how we can improve Public Local News app. Please email us at: info@closeapp.in",
